  "mapping_note": "Direct mappings cover standard federation save request/completion and status query/response, plus restore request/result, restore initiation and identity metadata, restore completion notification, and restore status query/response. Callback disable/enable suppression and release and callback-model-specific servicing are supplemental public-API checks. Untimed Initiate Federate Save label metadata is verified but not separately mapped because its available candidate clause reference is inconsistent with the source passage; no clause is inferred for it. This slice tests lifecycle coordination, not provider-specific persistence format or application-state serialization.",
  "notes": "This contract records the portable C++ TCK check for callback enable and disable around standard federation save and restore lifecycle callbacks. The source uses only the standard C++ RTIambassador and FederateAmbassador APIs plus the standard library; the adapter supplies the provider package, FOM, endpoint, and callback configuration. It verifies suppression and release of save initiation/completion, save-status, restore initiation/status, and restore-completion callbacks, exact labels and identity metadata, and federation cleanup without asserting provider-specific names, registries, headers, or implementation behavior.",
  "api_surfaces": [
